  "title": "Easy Sweet Potato Dumplings",
  "description": "This sweet potato dumpling recipe can be used for a veggie dish or a desert. They are so yummy and easy to make.",
  "authors": [
    "Belinda Owens McMath"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:33:04-04:00",
